# REST Client example: replace placeholders locally; do not commit passwords.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@anPassword = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@staffPassword = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@anAccount = REPLACE_WITH_UUID
@binhAccount = REPLACE_WITH_UUID

### Read your account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{anAccount}}
Authorization: Basic an {{anPassword}}

### Transfer; repeat this request unchanged to test idempotency
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Authorization: Basic an {{anPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: learning-transfer-001

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{anAccount}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "{{binhAccount}}",
  "amount": "300000",
  "description": "Tien sach"
}

### History
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{anAccount}}/entries?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Basic an {{anPassword}}

### Staff blocks account (unblock with ACTIVE)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{anAccount}}/status
Authorization: Basic staff {{staffPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"BLOCKED"}

### Staff creates customer (save returned ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Basic staff {{staffPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Chi"}
